<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Nehemiah</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hacaliah capa Nehemiah e lawk teh, Artaxerxes abawinae kum 20, Khislev thapa, siangpahrang khopui Shushan im ka o navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka nawngha Hanani hoi Judah ram e tami tangawn a tho awh teh Judah taminaw san dawk hoi ka hlout ni teh kaawm rae naw hoi, Jerusalem e a kongnaw hah ka pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni kai koevah, san thung hoi ka tâcawt ni teh hot ram dawk kaawm awh rae naw ni, kalenpounge roedengnae hoi hnephnapnae thung ao awh. Jerusalem rapan pueng a rawp teh longkhanaw hmai koung a kak telah a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hote lawk ka thai navah ka tahung teh ka kâ. A hnin moikasawlah ka lung a mathoe teh rawcahai lahoi kalvan kaawm Cathut koe ka ratoum e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oe kalvan kaawm e Jehovah Cathut, kalen ni teh takikatho poung e Cathut, nang lungpataw niteh, na kâpoelawknaw ka tarawi e lathueng vah, lawkkam na kuep sak teh lungmanae kamnueksakkung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isarelnaw hanelah, na hmalah amom tangmin ka ratoum teh Isarelnaw lah kaawm e kaimouh ni ka sakpayon e yonnaw ka pâpho awh teh ka kâhei awh e naw hah sahnin na thai pouh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kai hoi ka miphunnaw ni ka payon awh toe. Cathut nang koe ka yon awh teh, panuetthopounge hno ka sakpayon awh toe. Na san Mosi koe na poe e kâpoelawknaw, phunglawknaw, lawkcengnaenaw ka tarawi awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na san Mosi koevah yuemkamcu lah na awm awh hoehpawiteh miphun pueng kâkapek sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatei kai koe bout na ban awh teh kâpoelawknaw bout na tarawi awh pawiteh kalvan rahim ahla poungnae koe pâlei e lah na o awh nakunghai, hote hmuen koehoi bout na pâkhueng vaiteh ka min o nahan ka rawi e hmuen koe na ceikhai han telah Mosi koe lawk na poe e hah pahnim hanh lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atuvah taminaw teh kalenpounge na thaonae hoi karang poung e na kut hoi na ratang e taminaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Oe BAWIPA na san ni ratoumnae hoi na min ka bari e na sannaw ratoumnae lawk hah na thai pouh haw. Na san heh sahnin yawhawinae poe haw. Hete tami hmalah minhmai kahawi na hmawt sak haw telah ka ratoum. Hatnavah kai teh siangpahrang e manang kuenkung lah ka o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Artaxerxes bawi kum 20, Nisan thapa nah misurtui ka la teh, siangpahrang hah ka poe. Ha hoehnahlan teh, a hmalah ka minhmai mathout boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siangpahrang ni bangkongmaw na minhmai a mathoe. Patawnae hai na tawn hoeh. Alouke bang mahoeh, na lungthung hoi lungmathoe e doeh kaawm telah na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kai ni hai siangpahrang na hringsaw seh. Ka mintoenaw onae khopui a rawk teh longkhanaw hmai koung a kak navah, minhmai mathout laipalah bangtelamaw ka o thai han telah ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang ni bangmaw hei han na ngai telah na pacei. Hahoi, kalvan kaawm e Cathut koe ka ratoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siangpahrang koevah, siangpahrang na lungkuep boilah, na san ni minhmai kahawi kahmawt pawiteh, ka mintoenaw onae khopui bout ka pathout thai nahanelah, Judah kho ka cei thai nahanlah ka kâhei telah ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrangnu hai ateng vah a tahung teh, siangpahrang ni nâyittouh maw na ro han. Nâtuek maw bout na ban han telah na pacei. Hahoi kai ni atueng ka khoe teh, siangpahrang ni lunghawicalah na cei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi siangpahrang koevah, siangpahrang na lungkuep pawiteh tui namran lah kaawm e lawkcengkungnaw ka kâhmo nah Judah ram totouh ka cei thai nahanlah ca na thun pouh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang e ratu ka ring e Asaph koe, Bawkim longkha hoi longkha khomnaw hane, khorapan hoi ka o nahane im han lah thing na poe nahane hoi kâpoenae ca hai na poe nahanelah ka hei e patetlah, Cathut pahren lahoi Siangpahrang ni kai koe na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hahoi tui namran lah kaawm e khobawinaw koe ka pha teh siangpahrang koe e ca hah ka poe. Hahoi siangpahrang ni kai koevah ransabawi hoi marangransanaw hah a tha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isarel miphunnaw hanlah hnokahawi ka sak hane tami buet touh a tho tie Horon tami Sanballat hoi Ammon tami san lah kaawm e Tobiahnaw ni a thai awh navah puenghoi a lungkhuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahoi Jerusalem vah ka pha teh hnin thum touh hawvah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tangmin vah ka thaw teh kama koe ka hrawi e tami tangawn hoi Jerusalem hanelah Cathut ni ka lungthin dawk na poe e hah alouke tami api koehai ka dei pouh hoeh. Ka kâcuie marang hloilah saring alouke banghai ka sin hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hat hnin tangmin vah, ayawn longkha koehoi ka tâco teh khorui longkha hoi vaipuen longkha koe lah ka cei. Jerusalem rapan ka rawk e hoi longkha ka kang e naw hah ka khet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuikhu longkha koehoi siangpahrang tuiim totouh ka cei hatei, ka kâcuie marang a cei nahan lamthung awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahoi tangmin vah palang kahrawng teh rapannaw ka khet. Hahoi bout ka ban teh ayawn longkha dawk hoi bout ka kâen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lawkcengkungnaw ni nâmaw ka cei tie hoi bangmaw ka sak tie panuek awh hoeh. Judahnaw, vaihmabawinaw, lawkcengkungnaw, hoi alouke thaw katawkkungnaw koe banghai ka dei pouh hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi teh ahnimouh koevah maimouh ni khang e roedengnae Jerusalem a rawk e, kho longkha hmai kakangnaw hai na hmu awh toe tho awh haw pathoenae dawk hoi hlout nahanelah Jerusalem khopui teh bout sak lei sei telah ka dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi lathueng Cathut ahawinae hoi siangpahrang ni ca a thut e naw hah ka dei pouh teh, ahnimouh ni thâw awh vaiteh sak awh leih sei telah ati awh. Hahoi teh hote thaw kahawi tawk hanelah a kuttha ao sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatnavah, Horon tami Sanballat san lah kaawm e Ammon miphun Tobiah, Arab tami Geshem tinaw ni a thai awh toteh na panuikhai awh teh na hnephnap awh. Hno na sak e naw heh bangmaw. Siangpahrang na taran awh e doeh khe telah na ti pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatnavah ahnimae lawk teh ka pathung; kalvan e Cathut ni kaimouh hanelah a kuep sak han. Hatdawkvah, Cathut e san lah kaawm e kaimouh ni ka thaw awh vaiteh ka sak awh han. Hatei, nangmouh teh Jerusalem e coe hane thoseh, kâtawn hane hai thoseh, pâkuem hane hai thoseh na tawn awh hoeh telah ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hottelah vaihma kacue Eliashib teh, a hmaunawngha vaihmanaw hoi a thaw awh teh, tu longkha a pathoup awh. Hote a thoungsak hnukkhu tho a sak awh. Meah imrasang hoi Hananel imrasang totouh a pathang awh teh, a thoungsak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Jeriko taminaw ni a pathoup awh. Hathnukkhu Imri capa Zakkur ni a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanga longkha teh Hassenaah capanaw ni a pathoup awh. A taren nahanelah takhang, takhang tâphai, a rawngkhan nahanelah sumtaboung a sak awh teh, a taren awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimae hnukkhu, Uriah capa Hakkoz e cava Meremoth ni a pathoup. Hathnukkhu, Berekhiah capa, Meshezabel e cava Meshullam ni a pathoup. Hahoi Baana capa Zadok ni a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Tekoanaw ni a pathoup awh. Hateiteh khothung e a lungkahanaw ni a bawipa e thaw, aloung dawk patue han ngai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hothloilah, longkha karuem teh Paseah capa Jehoiada, hoi Besodeiah capa Meshullam ni a pathoup. A taren nahanelah tho lawng takhangnaw a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Gibeon tami Melatiah hoi Meronoth tami Jadon ni tui namran lah kaawm e Gibeonnaw Mizpah taminaw hoi pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, sui kahlun e thung hoi Harhaiah capa Uzziah ni a pathoup. Hahoi hmuitui ka sak e thung hoi Hananiah ni a pathoup teh rapan kakawpoung tie Jerusalem totouh a kalup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Jerusalem khopui tangawn ka uk e Hur capa Rephaiah ni a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi, Harumaph capa Jedaiah hoi a imhma lae ni pathoup. Hahoi Hashabneiah capa Hattush ni a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harim capa Malkhijah hoi Pahathmoab capa Hasshub ni bout a pathoup teh imrasang dawk e takhuen hai a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Jerusalem khopui tangawn ka uk e, Hallohesh capa Shallum ni a canunaw hoi a pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ayawn dawk e longkha teh Hanun hoi Zanoah ni a pathoup. Tho taren nahane hoi longkha hai tawngtang a sak. Songnawng longkha totouh rapan a pathoup e dong 10, 000 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Songnawng longkha teh Bethhakkerem khopui kaukkung Rekhab capa Malkhijah ni a pathoup. Tho a taren nahane naw hoi rawngkhan nahane naw hai tawngtang a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mizpah khopui kaukkung Kolhozeh capa Shallum ni tuikhu longkha a pathoup teh lemphu hai a padi hnukkhu, longkha taren nahane hai tawngtang a sak. Siangpahrang takha teng e Shiloh tuiim rapan teh Devit khopui hoi cathuknae lam totouh a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahni hnukkhu Bethzur khopui atangawn ka uk e, Azbuk capa Nehemiah ni Devit phuen tuiim hoi athakaawme taminaw e im totouh a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Levih tami Bani capa Rehum ni a pathoup. Hahoi Keilah khopui tangawn ka uk e Hasabiah ni amae khopui hanelah a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi Keilah khopui tangawn kaukkung Henadad capa Bavvainaw ni a pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahni hnukkhu, Mizpah kho kaukkung Jeshua capa Ezer ni kâtuknae puengcang hrueknae koelah luennae a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Zabbai capa Baruk ni lungthocalah hoi, alouk lae hmuen, kho takin koehoi vaihma kacue Eliashib e im takhang totouh a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahni hnukkhu vah Koz capa, Uriah capa Meremoth ni Eliashib im takhang koehoi Eliashib im apout totouh a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahni hnukkhu atengpam e vaihmanaw ni a pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahni hnukkhu Benjamin hoi Hasshub ni a imhma totouh a pathoup roi. Hathnukkhu teh Ananiah capa, Maaseiah capa Azariah ni a im hma han a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahni hnukkhu Henadad capa Binnui ni Azariah im koehoi khopui rapan longkawinae koehoi khopui takin totouh a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzzai capa Palal ni imrasang longkawinae koehoi thongim teng siangpahrang im sak e im totouh a pathoup. Hathnukkhu Parosh capa Pedaiah ni a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hothloilah, Nethinim tami Ophel vah kho ka sak e taminaw ni kanîtholah e tui longkha totouh hoi imrasang totouh a pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Tekoa taminaw ni alawilah kadangka lae rapan koehoi Ophel imrasang totouh a pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Marang longkha a lathueng lae teh, vaihmanaw ni a imhma lae lengkaleng a pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahni hnukkhu, Immer capa Zadok ni a imhma lae a pathoup. Kanîtholae longkha ramvengkung Shekaniah capa Shemaiah ni a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hahoi, Shelemiah capa Hananiah hoi Zalaph capa ataruk e Hanunnaw ni alouklouk lae a pathoup awh. Ahni hnukkhu, Berekhiah capa Meshullam ni a onae hmalae a pathoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, sui kahlunkung thung hoi Malkhijah ni Miphkad longkha hmalae Nethinim taminaw e im hoi hno kayawtnaw e im totouh hoi, a takin koe lah ceinae tangkham totouh a pathoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hahoi, a takin koe lah ceinae tangkham hoi Tu longkha rahak e teh suikahlunnaw hoi hno kayawtnaw ni a pathoup awh. -
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hateiteh, hettelah ao. Sanballat ni rapan pathoupnae akong a thai toteh, puenghoi a lungkhuek teh Judahnaw hah a dudam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmaunawnghanaw hoi Samaria ransanaw e hmalah lawk a dei teh, hate Judahnaw a tha kaawm hoehnaw ni bangmaw a sak thai awh han vai. Khopui bout kangdue sak hane maw a noe awh vai, thuengnae bout sak hanelah vaimoe ka kang tangcoung e talungnaw songnawng um e rasa vaiteh bout pathoup awh han vaimoe telah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ateng kaawm e Ammon tami Tobiah ni sak e rapannaw hah Asui ni mah luen sin pawiteh, ei ka rawm ca han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Oe ka Cathut na khenhaw! dudam e tami lah ka o awh. Kaimouh na pathoe e naw amamae lû dawk bawt naseh. Ahnimouh hai alouke ram buetbuet touh dawk yeiraipo van seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lawkkamnae hah ramuk pouh hanh. A yonnae teh na hmalah roum sak hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, rapan kapathoupnaw hmalah nang lung na khuek sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hateiteh, kaimouh ni khopui rapan hah ka pathoup awh. Ka pathoup e taminaw teh a lungmanae a len dawkvah, khopui a tengpam hoi khopui rapan rasang tangawn totouh ka pacoung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hat navah, Sanballat hoi Tobiah hoi Arab taminaw, Ammonnaw hoi Asdodnaw ni Jerusalem rapan te pou a pathoup awh tie kong a thai awh navah, puenghoi a lungkhuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi teh, Jerusalem tarantuk hane hoi runae poe hanelah a kâcai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hateiteh, kaimouh ni Cathut koe ka ratoum awh teh, amom tangmin kâhat laipalah ramveng ka ta awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judahnaw ni thaw katawkkungnaw teh a tâwn poung awh toe. Songnawngnaw hai apap poung, rapan pathoup thai mahoeh toe ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tarannaw ni hai ahnimanaw kâhruetcuet awh hoeh nah cei awh vaiteh, thawnaw raphoe pouh sei ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahnimae ateng kaawm e Judahnaw ni, tarannaw teh onae alouklouk lahoi tho awh vaiteh nangmouh na tuk awh han toe telah boutbout a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, rapan e a hnukkhu lah, ka rahnoum e hmuen kathounge, hmuen dawk tahloi, tahroe, licung ka sin e taminaw hah a miphun lahoi thaw ka poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thaw teh ka khet. Bawinaw, lawkcengkungnaw hoi alouke taminaw ka kaw teh, tarannaw taket awh hanh, kalenpounge hoi takikatho poung e Cathut pahnim laipalah, hmaunawnghanaw, canunaw, yunaw hoi imnaw karoumcalah o thai nahan tawk awh ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tarannaw ni a noe awh e naw hah Cathut ni a raphoe pouh tie na panue sak e ka panue awh toteh, rapan pathoup hanelah mae hmuen koe lengkaleng ka ban awh teh ka tawk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hahoi teh, tangawn ni thaw a tawk awh, tangawn ni tahroe bahling, sumangkinaw a patuep awh. Hahoi lawkcengkungnaw teh Judah imthung e a hnuklah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rapan pathoup nahanlah hno kaphawtnaw ni hai kutvang hoi thaw tawk awh teh, kutvang hoi senehmaica a patuep awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnavah, napui tongpanaw ni a miphun lah kaawm e Judahnaw hah a taran awh teh puenghoi a hramki awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tangawn ni kaimae canunaw hoi capanaw moi apap. Ahnimanaw ka paca hane nâ e rawca namaw ka la awh han ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tangawn ni kaimae law, takha, imnaw hoi ka pâhung awh toe. Canei takangnae atueng nâ e maw ka hmu awh han vah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangawn ni kaimouh ni siangpahrang koe aphawng poe hanelah law, takha naw hane tangka ka cawi awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atuvah maimae takthainaw teh miphun buet touh e takthai patetlah doeh ao. Maimae canaw teh ahnimae canaw patetlah doeh ao awh. Maimae canaw hah yo vaiteh, san lah o sak han namaw. San dawk kaawm e canunaw patenghai ratang thai awh hoeh. Law hoi misur takhanaw pueng ayânaw e kut dawk a pha toe ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hettelah hramnae lawk ka thai navah puenghoi ka lungkhuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi, kahawicalah kho ka pouk teh bawinaw hoi lawkcengkungnaw ka kaw teh, nangmouh ni na hmaunawngha koe bangkongmaw apung na ca awh vaw telah ka yue teh, hote kong kâpankhai nahanelah taminaw teh ka kamkhueng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jentelnaw koe kaawm e hmaunawngha Judah taminaw hah a coung thai totouh ka ratang awh teh, nangmouh ni hmaunawnghanaw bout na yo awh han rah maw, nangmouh ni hmaunawnghanaw bout na kâyo awh han rah maw telah ka yue teh lawkkamuem duem ao awh teh, pathung nahane lawk tawn awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hahoi kai ni, nangmouh ni na sak e hnonaw hawihoeh. Maimae taran lah kaawm e Jentelnaw ni na dudam awh han. Nangmouh ni Cathut taki laihoi hnokahawi sak kawi nahoehmaw ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai hoi hmaunawngha, ka sannaw ni taminaw koehoi e hnopai hoi cainaw kârei thai awh van nahoehmaw. Apung canae teh pâpout awh leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sahnin roeroe vah ahnimae law, takha, Olive takhanaw hoi imnaw amamouh koehoi na kâreikhai e cai, misurtui hoi satuinaw 100 touh dawk buet touh na la awh e pueng hai bout poe awh leih ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni hai bout ka poe awh han toe. Banghai bout ka lat awh mahoeh toe. Na dei e patetlah ka sak awh han ati awh. Hahoi vaihmanaw ka kaw teh lawkkam e patetlah tawk hanelah lawkkamnae ka sak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai ni hai kâkhu e ka kathuek teh, hete lawkkam ka tarawi hoeh e tami teh Cathut ni im dawk hoi thoseh, a thaw dawk hoi thoseh kathuek van naseh telah taminaw koe ka dei navah ahnimouh ni Amen telah ati awh. BAWIPA a pholen awh. Hahoi teh taminaw pueng ni lawkkam patetlah a tawksak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah ram ukkung lah ka o navah siangpahrang Artaxerxes kum 20 touh hoi kamtawng teh kum 32 totouh, kum 12 touh thung kai hoi ka hmaunawnghanaw ni ukkung e tamuk ka lat boi awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahmaloe ukkungnaw teh taminaw hanelah hnokari poung lah ao awh. Vaiyei hoi misurtui hai thoseh, hnin touh dawk sekel 40 touh a poe awh. Hothloilah a sannaw koehoi dumyennae hai a kâhmo awh. Hatei kai teh Cathut ka taki dawkvah hottelah ka sak hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hothloilah, kai teh khopui rapan doeh pou ka pathoup. Kai hoi ka sannaw ni la ka ran awh hoeh. Khopui rapan pathoup hane doeh lungkângingcalah kâyawm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi miphun alouke hoi ka tho e dei laipalah, Judah miphunnaw hoi lawkcengkungnaw 150 touh ni ka caboi dawk rawca pou a ven awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnintangkuem maito buet touh, tu 6 touh hoi ânaw pou a thei awh hloilah, hnin 10 touh dawk vai touh misurtui aphunphun ka nei awh. Hettelah ka baw nakunghai taminaw ni puenghoi thaw a tawk awh dawkvah, khobawi ni pang hane kawi ka het boi awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />OE ka Cathut, hete taminaw hanelah hnokahawi ka sak e dawkvah kai heh kahawi nahanelah na pahnim pouh hanh lah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnavah, khopui longkha ka cum awh hoeh rah eiteh, khopui rapan teh a cak toe tie Sanballat hoi Tobiah hoi Arab tami Geshem hoi alouke tarannaw ni kamthang a thai awh toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sanballat hoi Geshem ni tho haw, Ono hmuen koe kâhmo awh sei telah kahawihoehe pouknae hoi lawk na thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kai ni hai, patounenaw ka patoun teh, kai teh thaw kalenpounge ka tawk dawkvah ka tho thai mahoeh. Bangkong hete thawnaw ka ceitakhai vaiteh, nangmouh koe khuet ka tho han vaw telah lawk bout ka thaisak van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hottelah, vai pali touh hane lawk na thui eiteh, hettelah doeh boutbout ka dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hat torei teh, Sanballat ni hottelah ca bout a thut teh, paawng tangcoung e ca a sanpa buet touh koe a phu sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ca dawk thut lah kaawm e teh, nang hoi Judahnaw ni kâtaran hane na noe awh dawkvah, rapan na pathoup awh titeh alouke miphunnaw ni a dei awh. Geshem ni hai a dei. Hete lawk hoi kâkuen lah nang teh Judah siangpahrang lah o han na ngai dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah ram dawk siangpahrang ao telah na kong hah siangpahrang koevah karanglah a kamthang han. Hatdawkvah, tho nateh kâdeikâpan sei telah ca a thut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatnavah, kai ni hai lawk na dei e naw buet touh hai atang nahoeh. Na pouk e na dei rumram e doeh telah tami buet touh ka tha te ka dei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh ni a tawk e thawnaw teh cum thai awh mahoeh, thayoun awh han doeh telah pouk lahoi na pakhinae doeh. Hatdawkvah, atuteh oe Cathut ka kutnaw hah tha awm sak haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi, Mehetabel capa, Delai capa Shemaiah ni kâhronae im dawk ka cei navah ahni ni Cathut e im Bawkim thung kâhmo awh vaiteh, Bawkim thonaw khan awh sei. Nang ka thet hane taminaw a tho awh han, tangmin nakunghai a tho awh han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai nihai, kai patetlah e tami ni khuet ka yawng han namaw. Kai hoi kâvan e tami ni a hring nahanelah Bawkim thung kâen han namaw, ka kâen mahoeh ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahoi kai ni ka thai panuek e teh, Cathut ni a tha e nahoeh. Kai hoi kâtaran lah sutdeilawk a pathang e doeh. Tobiah hoi Sanballat ni a hlai roi e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, hottelah ka sak lahoi yonnae sak sak vaiteh, na pathoe hane a ngai dawk, a hlai e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Oe ka Cathut, hettelah ka sak e Tobiah hoi Sanballat hoi profet napui Noadiah hoi alouke profetnaw hah pahnim han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rapan a cum awh teh, hnin 52 hnukkhu, Elul thapa hnin 25 nah ka cum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote kamthang teh tarannaw ni a thai awh teh, alouke miphunnaw ni rapan a hmu awh navah, puenghoi a taki awh teh, hete hnonaw heh Cathut ni a sak e doeh tie a panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatnavah, Judah bawinaw ni Tobiah koe ca moi a patoun awh teh, Tobiah koe e ca hai a hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tobiah teh Arah capa, Shekaniah e cava lah ao teh, a capa Jehohanan Berekhiah, capa Meshullam, canu hoi ao roi dawkvah, Judahnaw ni Tobiah koe lawk a kam awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni Tobiah hnokahawi a sak e naw hah kai koe bout a dei awh. Kaie lawk hai ahni koe bout a dei pouh awh. Ahnimouh ni hai kai ni taki sak nahane ca bout na poe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rapannaw ka pathoup awh teh longkhanaw ka cum awh hnukkhu, longkha karingkung hoi la kasakkung lah Levih miphunnaw hah thaw ka poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Yuemkamcu lah kaawm ni teh Cathut ka taket e ransabawi Hananiah hoi ka nawngha Hanan teh Jerusalem ka uk sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem longkhanaw teh kanî a tâco hoehnahlan vah paawng sak hanh. Tangmin lah karingkungnaw ni longkha kacaklah taren awh naseh. Hahoi khocanaw ni amamouh onae hmuen koehai thoseh, a imnaw koehoi thoseh ramveng awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, santoungnae koehoi, bout ban nateh, khopui teh akaw eiteh khothung kaawm e taminaw ayounca dawkvah, imnaw sak thai awh hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka Cathut ni ka lungthung vah, bari e naw hoi lawkcengkungnaw hoi tamimaya a kaw teh, a tâconae patetlah min thut hanelah na dei pouh. Hahoi ahmaloe kabannaw kakhekungnaw min thutnae cauk hah ka hmu. Hot dawkvah hettelah thut e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />San dawk hrawi lah kaawm e, Babilon siangpahrang Nebukhadnezar ni hrawi lah kaawm niteh, san dawk hoi a tâco teh Jerusalem hoi Judah ram e amamouh onae koe bout ka ban ni teh kho ka sak e milunaw teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem koe ka tho e naw teh, Joshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordekai, Bilshan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum hoi Baanah. Ahnimanaw hoi cungtalah ka tho e Isarel miphunnaw teh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Parosh ca catounnaw 2, 172
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Shefatiah ca catounnaw 372
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arah ca catounnaw 652
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jeshua hoi Joab catoun thung hoi e Pahathmoab ca catounnaw 2, 818
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elam ca catounnaw 1, 254
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zattu ca catounnaw 845
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zakkai ca catounnaw 760
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Binnui ca catounnaw 648
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bebai ca catounnaw 628
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azgad ca catounnaw 2322
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adonikam ca catounnaw 667
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bigvai ca catounnaw 2, 067
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adin ca catounnaw 655
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezekiah capa thung hoi e Ater ca catounnaw 98
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hashum ca catounnaw 328
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bezai ca catounnaw 324
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hariph ca catounnaw 112
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon ca catounnaw 95
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bethlehem hoi Netophah taminaw 188
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nathoth ca catounnaw 128
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bethazmaveth ca catounnaw 42
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />KiriathJearim, Kephirah hoi Beeroth tami 143
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ram hoi Geba ca catounnaw 621
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mikmas ca catounnaw 122
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bethel hoi Ai tami 123
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nebo alouke ca catounnaw 52
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elam alouke ca catounnaw 1, 254
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harim ca catounnaw 231
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jeriko ca catounnaw 345
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lod, Hadiel hoi Ono ca catounnaw 721
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Senoah ca catounnaw 3, 930
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Vaihmanaw: Jeshua imthungkhu Jedaiah ca catounnaw 973
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Immer ca catounnaw 1052
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pashhur ca catounnaw 1247
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Harim ca catounnaw 1017
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Levih ca catounnaw : Hodaviah capa thung hoi e Kadmiel tami Jeshua ca catounnaw 74
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />La kasakkung: Asaph ca catounnaw 148
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />longkha ka ring e naw: Shallum ca catounnaw, Akkub ca catounnaw, Hatita ca catounnaw hoi Shobai ca catounnaw 138
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nethin tami: Ziha ca catounnaw, Hasupha ca catounnaw, Tabbaoth ca catounnaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Keros ca catounnaw, sia ca catounnaw, padon ca catounnaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lebana ca catounnaw, Hagaba ca catounnaw, Salmai catounnaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hanan ca catounnaw, Giddel ca catounnaw, Gahar ca catounnaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Reaiah ca catoun, Rezin ca catoun, Nekoda ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gazzam ca catoun, Uzza ca catoun, Paseah ca catoun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Besai ca catoun, Meunim ca catoun, Nefishesim ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bakbuk ca catoun, Hakupha ca catoun, Harhur ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bazlith ca catoun, Mehida ca catoun, Harsha ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Barkos ca catoun, Sisera ca catoun, Tamah ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Neziah ca catoun, Hatipha ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Solomon koe kaawm e naw; Sotai catoun, Sofereth ca catoun, Perida ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jaala ca catoun, Darkon ca catoun, Giddel ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Shefatiah ca catoun, Hattil ca catoun, Pokhereth Hazzebaim ca catoun, Ammon ca catoun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Nathil taminaw hoi Solomon koe kaawm e abuemlah 392 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Telmelah, Telharsha, Kherub, Addoh, Immer ni a moan e naw teh hetnaw doeh. A mintoe, imthungkhu hoi catounnaw hah Isarel miphun katang hoi katang hoeh e hah parui thai awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Hotnaw teh: Delaiah ca catoun, Tobiah ca catoun Nekoda ca catoun 642
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Vaihma miphun thung hoi: Habaiah ca catoun Koz ca catoun Gilead tami Barzillai canu yu lah ka lat e Barzillai ca catoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni milu touknae dawk amamae milu thut e a hmu awh hoeh dawk kakuep hoeh e miphun vaihma thaw tawk mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Umri hoi Thumim ni hrawi e Profet a tho hoeh roukrak teh ahnimouh ni kathoungpounge rawcanaw cat mahoeh telah kho bawi ni atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tamihupui abuemlah 42, 360 a pha
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Sannu, sanpanaw 7, 337; la ka sak e napui tongpa 245 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Marangnaw 736 touh a pha teh ka kalen phunnaw 245 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Kalauknaw 435 lanaw 6, 720 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Hahoi kahrawikung tangawn ni thaw tawk nahanelah hnopai a poe awh. Khokung ni hai sui derik 1,000, maroi 50, hoi vaihmanaw e khohna 530 touh a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Kahrawikung tangawnnaw ni im sak nahanelah sui darik 20,000 touh hoi ngun khing 2, 200 touh a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Hahoi alouke taminaw ni poe e naw teh sui derik 20, 222 touh hoi ngun khing 2,000 touh hoi vaihmanaw e khohna 67 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thapa yung sari a pha hoi, hmuen tangkuem koe kaawm e Isarelnaw pueng teh, a tho awh teh Tui longkha koe a kamkhueng awh. Isarelnaw koe lawk a poe e teh, Mosi kâlawk cauk sin loe telah kâlawk kacangkhaie Ezra koe a hei e patetlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaihma Ezra ni vah kâlawk teh, napui tongpa hoi ka thai panuek hane ka kamkhuengnaw e hmalah thapa yung sari, apasuek hnin vah a thokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tui longkha hmalah kaawm e thongma lah kangvawi laihoi amom hoi tangmin totouh, ka thai panuek hane napui tongpa hmalah, kâlawk hah a touk pouh teh taminaw ni kahawicalah a thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni a sak awh e lawkdeinae tungkhung van a kangdue teh ahnie atengvah aranglah, Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah hoi Maaseiah, hahoi avoilah, Pedaiah, Mishael, Malkhijah, Hashum, Hashbaddanah, Zekhariah hoi, Meshullam a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ezra ni cauk hah taminaw e mithmu vah a kadai. Ahni teh taminaw hlakvah hmuen rasang koe a kangdue. A kadai toteh tami pueng a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra ni BAWIPA a lentoenae a pholen teh, taminaw ni a kut a dâw awh teh, Amen, Amen, telah a dei awh teh, a lûsaling laihoi BAWIPA a bawk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Taminaw ni a onae hmuen koe be ao awh lahun navah, Levih tami Jeshua, Bani, Sherebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Shabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozabad, Hanan, Pelaiah naw ni hai taminaw kâlawk a panue awh nahanelah a thaisak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cathut e kâlawk cauk thung e kamcengcalah a touk awh teh, a ngainae a dei pouh dawkvah, taminaw ni a touk awh e hah a thai panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hahoi ukkung bawi lah kaawm e, Nehemiah hoi vaihma hoi kâlawk kacangkhaikung Ezra hoi taminaw kacangkhaie Levihnaw ni vah, taminaw koe sahnin heh, Bawipa na Cathut e hnin kathoung doeh. Na lung mathout hanh awh. Kap hai kap awh hanh atipouh awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, kâlawk a thai awh navah taminaw teh a khuika awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cet awh haw. Bu katuicalah cat awh nateh, misurtui karadip e net awh. Banghai ka tawn hoeh e koe kâreikhai awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, sahnin heh Bawipa e hnin kathoung doeh. BAWIPA dawk na lunghawinae teh na thayung lah ao dawkvah, na lungmathout hanh awh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Levihnaw ni taminaw sairasuep lah ao sak. Sahnin teh hnin kathounge lah ao dawkvah, sairasuepcalah awm awh. Na lungmathout awh hanh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taminaw ni a dei e lawknaw a thai panuek awh dawkvah, canei kawi sak hane hoi alouknaw hai kâreikhai hane hoi lunghawi nawmnae kalen poung sak hanelah be a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Apâhni hnin navah, a imthungkhu dawk e kacue lah kaawm e hah vaihmanaw hoi, Levihnaw teh phunglawk kamtu hanelah, cungtalah kâlawk kacangkhaikung Ezra koe a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Phunglawk thung vah BAWIPA ni Mosi koe kâlawk a poe teh, a thut e hah a hmu awh. Hote thung vah Isarelnaw teh, thapa yung sarinae pawi dawk teh im ao awh hane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kho tangkuem hoi Jerusalem khopui vah pathang pouh hane hoi, mon vah cet awh nateh, olivekungnaw hoi kahrawng e olive hna, tuihan hna, samtue hna hoi, a hna kahawi e a kang pueng rim sak nahanelah lat awh. Hahoi rim teh hettelah na sak awh han tie patetlah na sak awh han tie hah ca a thut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a cei awh teh, a la awh. A im dawk thoseh, thongma dawk thoseh, Cathut e im thoseh, Tui longkha lawilah thoseh, Ephraim longkha alawilah thoseh, rim lengkaleng a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />San dawk hoi kahlout pueng ni rim lengkaleng a sak awh teh, rim thungvah ao awh. Hothateh, Nun capa Joshua tueng hoi hot hnin totouh, Isarelnaw ni a sak awh boihoeh e lunghawinae kalen poung a tawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kamtawng hnin koehoi apoutnae hnin totouh, Cathut e kâlawk cauk hah pou a touk awh. Pawi teh hnin sari touh a sak awh teh, ataroe hnin vah amamae singyoe patetlah kamkhuengnae pawi hai a sak awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hot patetlah, hate thapa 24 hnin nah Isarelnaw teh rawcahai hoi buri kâkhu teh, vaiphu a kâphuen awh teh kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isarelnaw teh ram alouknaw koehoi aloukcalah ao awh teh, a yonnae naw hoi mintoenaw e payonnae hah kangdue laihoi a pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amamouh onae hmuen koe lengkaleng a kangdue awh teh, hnin touh hah pali touh lah a kapek awh teh, amamae hmuen koe lengkaleng a kangdue awh teh, buet touh dawk BAWIPA Cathut e kâlawk a touk awh. Buet touh dawk, yon a pâpho awh teh, buet touh dawk BAWIPA Cathut hah a bawk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hot patetlah, Levih taminaw khalai rasang dawk Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Bunni, Sherebiah, Bani hoi Kenani naw hah a kangdue awh teh, kacaipounglah BAWIPA Cathut hah a kaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hot patetlah, Levih tami, Jeshua hoi Kadmiel, Bani, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah, hoi Pethahiah naw ni kang dout awh nateh Jehovah Cathut teh a yungyoe hoi a yungyoe pholen awh. Pholennae a Lathueng Poung lah kaawm e, na min lentoenae teh pholennae awm seh telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi maya ni nang duengdoeh Jehovah lah na kaawm. Nama ni kalvan hah na sak. Kalvannaw e kalvan hoi athung kaawmnaw pueng hoi, talai hoi athung kaawmnaw pueng hoi, talî hoi athung kaawm e pueng hah na sak teh, abuemlah na khetyawt. Nang teh kalvan kaawm pueng ni na bawk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang ni Abraham na rawi teh, Khaldean ram Ur kho hoi na tâcokhai teh, a min lah Abraham telah na ka phung e Jehovah Cathut lah na o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lungthin teh na hmalah yuemkamcu lah na hmu teh, Kanaan tami, Hit tami, Amor tami, Periz tami, Jebusit tami hoi Girgashite taminaw e ram hah, ca catounnaw poe hanelah lawkkam na sak. Na lawk teh na kuep sak. Bangkongtetpawiteh nang teh na lan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izip ram e mintoenaw rucat khangnae hah na hmu teh, tuipuipaling teng e a hramki awh e lawk hah na thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Faro hoi ama koe kaawm e pueng hoi a ram dawk e tami pueng e lathueng vah, mitnoutnae kângairu hah na kamnue sak. Bangkongtetpawiteh, polainae nama dawk ouk a sak awh e hah, nama ni na panue. Hatdawkvah, nama hane na min hah na sak. Sahnin e kaawm e patetlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahoi ahnimae hmalah tui hah na kapek teh talai kaphui dawk na cei awh. Ahnimouh thoe ka bo e hah kadung e tui thung, athakaawme tui thung vah talung patetlah na tâkhawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kanîthun vah tâmaikhom hoi na hrawi teh, karum lah a cei awh nahane lamthung dawk ka tue hanelah hmaikhom hoi a hrawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sinai mon dawk hoi na kum teh, kalvan hoi ahnimouh koe lawk na dei. Kalan e lawkcengnae, kalan e kâlawk, phunglawknaw hoi kâpoelawk hah na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kathounge Sabbath hah na panue sak. Mosi hno lahoi kâ na poe. Phunglawknaw, kâpoelawknaw, hoi kâlawk hah na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahoi a vonhlam navah, kalvan hoi vaiyei na poe. Tui kahran awh navah, lungsong dawk hoi tui na tâcosak teh, poe hanelah na noe pouh e ram hah ao awh nahan na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hateiteh ahnimouh hoi mintoenaw ni polainae hoi a lungpata sak awh. Kâpoelawknaw hah tarawi awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tarawi han ngai awh hoeh. Kângairu hno na sak e naw hai thai han ngai awh hoeh toe. A lung hah a pata sak awh teh, taran a thaw awh teh san lah a onae koe lah ban hane kahrawikung hah a rawi awh. Hatei nang teh ngaithoum hanelah coungkacoe lah kaawm e Cathut, pahrennae lungmanae, hoi ka kawi e, lung kasawe, hawisaknae moi ka tawn e lah na o teh, ahnimouh teh na cettakhai boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Meikaphawk maitoca a sak awh teh, Izip ram hoi ka tâcawtkhai e Cathut teh puenghoi a lungkhuek nahanlah a sak awh nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lungmanae kalenpounge dawk hoi kahrawngum vah na cettakhai boihoeh. Lam ka hrawi hane tâmaikhom ni cettakhai boihoeh. Lam a hmu thai na hanelah karum lah hmaikhom ni cettakhai boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahnimouh ka cangkhai hanelah, kahawi e na Muitha hah na poe teh, mana hoi na kawk teh nei hanelah tui na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kahrawngum kum 40 touh thung na kawk. Banghai voutthoupnae awmhoeh. Hnicu a pawnnae awmhoeh. A khoknaw hai phing hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi uknaeram hoi miphun hah na poe teh ram buet touh hnukkhu buet touh na rei. Hottelah, Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon ram e, Bashan siangpahrang Og ram hah a la awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ca catounnaw teh kalvan e âsi yit touh na pung sak teh a coe awh hane mintoenaw koe na dei pouh e patetlah, ram dawk na kâenkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hot patetlah, ca catounnaw ni ram teh a coe awh. Nama ni hote ram dawk kaawm e Kanaan taminaw hah, ahnimae a hmalah na sung sak teh, a ngai patetlah a sak awh hanelah siangpahrangnaw hoi a ram e taminaw hah a kut dawk na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka cak e khopuinaw hoi, kahawipoung e ramnaw hah a la awh teh, hnokahawi phunkuep hoi kakawi e imnaw, tai tangcoung e tuikhunaw hoi misur takha hoi, olive takhanaw hoi thingthaikungnaw a pang awh. Hottelah a ca awh teh, a von a paha awh. A thaw teh na lentoenae, na hawinae dawk a phunep awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hateiteh, ahnimouh teh lawkngai awh hoeh. Na taran awh teh, kâlawk hah amamae hnuklah a ta awh teh, nang koe bout ban hanelah, ka yue e profet hah a thei awh teh, puenghoi a tounkhouk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ahnimouh hah amamae taran kut dawk na poe toe. Runae a kâhmo awh teh nang koe a hram awh toteh, kalvan hoi na thai pouh teh, lungmanae hoi na kawi dawkvah, taran kut dawk hoi rungngangkung hah na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hatei a kâhat awh toteh, na hmalah vah, hawihoehnae bout a sak awh dawkvah, taran kut dawk bout na poe. Ahnimouh ni bout a tho awh teh, nang koe bout a hram awh toteh, kalvan hoi na thai pouh teh lungmanae hoi na kawi dawkvah, boutbout na rungngang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nange kampangkhai e bout tarawi hanelah, na yue eiteh, ahnimouh ni ngâi awh laipalah, a kâoup awh. Katarawinaw koe hringnae lah kaawm e kâpoelawknaw hah a taran awh. Katepoung e lahuen hoi, lunglennae hoi tarawi laipalah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A kum moikapap ahnimouh na panguep teh, na Muitha lahoi na profetnaw hno lahoi na yue nakunghai, ahnimouh ni ngâi awh hoeh. Hatdawkvah, ram alouknaw e kut dawk na poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hatnavah nang ni pahrenlungmanae hoi kakawi e Cathut lah na o teh, pahrennae a len dawkvah, ahnimouh khoeroe na raphoe hoeh, na pahnawt hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, maimae Cathut, kalen, athakaawme, takikatho e Cathut, pahrennae hoi lawkkam kacakpounge, Assiria siangpahrang uknae koehoi sahnin totouh, kaimae siangpahrang bawi, vaihma, profet, a tami pueng e lathueng ka phat e runae pueng, banglahai noutna hoeh e lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nang ni kaimae lathueng na pha sak e hnonaw teh a kamsoum. Kaimanaw teh, kamsoum hoeh lah hno ka sak awh toe. Nang ni teh yuemkamcu lah na sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Maimae siangpahrang hoi ukkungnaw, maimae vaihma hoi mintoenaw ni hai, kâlawk tarawi awh hoeh. Kâpoelawk hoi na panuesaknae, na yuenae thai ngai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahnimanaw teh na uknaeram thung vah, kakaw poung, kahawipoung na poe e dawk thaw tawk ngai awh hoeh. Kahawi hoeh lah tawknae hai kâhat ngai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khenhaw! atuvah san lah o awh. Athung e canei katui e hoi hnokahawinaw hah yampa mintoenaw koe na poe e ram dawkvah san lah ka o awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka yon awh dawkvah, siangpahrangnaw ni kaimouh lathueng vah a bawi awh nahanelah, kaimae takthai hoi hnopainaw e lathueng a ngai awh e patetlah kâ a tawn awh toe. Ka lungreithai awh tangngak toe telah a dei awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hot patetlah lawkkamnae kacaksakkung teh, hetnaw doeh. Hakaliah capa ram ukkung Nehemiah hoi Zedekiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pashhur, Amariah, Malkhijah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluck,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maaziah, Bilgai, hoi, Shemaiah hetnaw he vaihmanaw lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levihnaw: Azaniah capa Joshua, Henadad capanaw thung dawk hoi Binnui hoi Kadmiel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hmaunawngha, Shebaniah, Hodiah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mikha, Rehob, Hashabiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zakkur, Sheribiah, Shebaniah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hodiah, Bani, Beninu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kacuenaw: Parosh, Pahathmoab, Elam, Zattu, Bani,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bunni, Azgad, Bebai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hodiah, Hashum, Bezai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hariph, Anathoth, Nebai
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshezabel, Zadok, Jaddua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hosi, Hananiah, Hasshub,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hallohesh, Pilha, Shobek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahijah, Hanan, Anan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Malluck, Harim, Hoi Baanah tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kacawirae vaihmanaw hoi Levihnaw hoi takhang karingnaw, la kasaknaw, Nethinimnaw hoi Cathut e kâlawk tarawi kangainaw teh, Hote ram e taminaw thung dawk hai, aloukcalah kaawmnaw a yu, a capa, a canunaw oang panuek tangcoungnaw ni
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a hmaunawngha hoi tami kalentoenaw hah, tha laipalah a kuet awh. Cathut e san Mosi koe poe e kâlawk tarawi han hoi Bawipa, maimae BAWIPA e kâpoelawknaw pueng, lawkcengnaenaw hoi phunglawknaw tarawi hanelah, pâkuem hanelah thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />hote ram dawk e taminaw ni, canunaw a la hoeh nahanlah capanaw hanlah a canunaw lat pouh laipalah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />hote ram dawk e taminaw ni, Sabbath hnin a yo awh e hno thoseh, canei hane phunkuep a yo han a sin e thoseh, Sabbath hnin hai thoseh, yanae hnin hai thoseh, pâtu laipalah, kum sari touh thung law dawk e ka tâcawt e lat laipalah, laibanaw pueng patho laipalah, o hane thoekâbo e hai taket laipalah, lawkkamnae hah a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cathut im thaw tawk nahanelah shekel pung thum pung touh, kum tangkuem poe hanelah phung ka sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Rathap tangcoung e vaiyei hai thoseh, tavai thueng pouh hane hai thoseh, hmaisawi thuengnae pou sak hane thoseh, sabbath hnin hane thoseh, thaparei tueng thoseh, atueng khoe pawinaw han thoseh, kathounge hno hane thoseh, Isarelnaw yontha nahanelah yon thuengnae thoseh, Cathut e im thawnaw pueng hanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />mintoenaw e imthungkhu tangkuem ni kumtangkuem atueng khoe e kâlawk cauk dawk thut e patetlah BAWIPA Cathut thuengnae koe, thing thueng e thing tangoung, Cathut im ka puen hanelah vaihma bawinaw hoi Levihnaw tamimaya hoi cungpam ka rayu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hahoi kumtangkuem, law dawk e aluepawnaw, thingthai hmaloe kapawnaw, BAWIPA im kâenkhai hanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kâlawk dawk thut tangcoung patetlah capa caminnaw, saring caminnaw hoi maitohu hoi, tuhu thung dawk hmaloe ka khe e naw hai Cathut e im thaw ka tawk vaihma bawinaw koe Cathut im vah ceikhai hane hai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cathut e imthungkhu vah, vaihmanaw koe tavai thuengnae hmaloe sak e thueng e pueng, thingthai phunkuep misurtui hoi satuinaw hai, law dawk e ka tâcawt pueng hra touh dawk pung touh, Levihnaw koe poe hane phung ka sak awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Levihnaw ni law ka sak e naw pueng thung e, pung hra pung touh ouk a la awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Levihnaw ni pung hra pung touh a la navah Aron catoun vaihma bawi teh Levihnaw koe ao hanelah ao. Levihnaw ni pung hra pung touh a la e thung dawk hoi pung hra pung touh teh Cathut im râw pâkuemnae imthungkhu a ta awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Isarel catoun hai Levih catounnaw cakang hoi misur, satui thuengnae pueng hmuen, kathoung, hlaumhlaam hoi thaw katawknaw, vaihma bawi takhang ka ring e la kasakkungnaw onae imthungkhu a ta han. Hot patetlah Cathut im vah pamda hoeh nahane phung ka sak awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnavah taminaw koe bawi thaw katawknaw teh Jerusalem vah ao awh. Alouke taminaw teh kathounge hmuen, Jerusalem vah hra touh dawk buet touh, hahoi alouke khonaw dawk tako touh o hanelah cungpam a rayu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi Jerusalem kaawm hane naw hah taminaw ni yawhawi a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hetnaw teh, ram uk hanelah Jerusalem vah kaawm e naw doeh. (Hateiteh Judah kho e naw teh a hnopai onae kho dawk ao awh. Ahnimanaw teh Isarel tami vaihma Levih tami hoi Nethinim tami hoi Solomon e a sannaw doeh).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem vah Judah catounnaw hoi Benjamin catounnaw ao awh. Judah catounnaw teh: Uzziah capa Athaiah, Zekhariah capa, Amariah capa, Shephatiah, capa Mahalalel capa, Perez capanaw hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baruk capa Maaseiah, Kolhozeh capa, Hazaiah capa, Adaiah capa, Joiarib capa, Zekhariah capa, Shilon capanaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Perez canaw Jerusalem kaawm e abuemlah 468 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin canaw teh hetnaw doeh: Meshullam capa Sallu, Joed capa, Pedaiah capa, Kolaiah capa, Maaseiah capa, Ithiel capa, Jeshaiah capa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hahoi Gabbai hoi Sallai abuemlahoi 928 touh a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zikhri capa Joel teh ahnimouh kahrawikung lah ao. Hassenuah capa Judah teh kho ukkung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaihmanaw thung hoi Joiarib capa Jedaiah hoi Jakhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hilkiah capa Seraiah, Meshullam capa, Zadok capa Meraioth capa, Ahitub capanaw teh Cathut e imthung kahrawikung lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Im dawk thaw ka tawk e hmaunawngha abuemlah 822 touh a pha. Hahoi Jeroham capa Adaiah, Pelaliah capa, Amzi capa, Zekhariah capa, Pashhur capa, Malkhijah capa hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hmaunawngha kahrawikungnaw teh 242 touh a pha. Hahoi Azarel capa Amashai, Ahzai ca catoun Meshillemoth capa Immer capanaw hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hmaunawnghanaw tarankahawi ni teh athakaawme taminaw 128 touh a pha awh. Ahnimouh kahrawikung teh Haggedolim capa Zabdiel doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahoi Levih imthungnaw teh: Hasshub capa Shemaiah, Azrikam capa, Hashabiah capa, Bunni capa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levih tami kahrawikungnaw thung dawk hoi Cathut im alawilae thaw kakhenkung teh Shabbethai hoi Jozabad doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mikha capa Mattaniah, Zabdi capa, Asaph capa ratoumnae dawk lunghawilawkdeinae ka dei e Mattaniah. Hahoi, a hmaunawngha thung hoi Bakbukiah hoi Jeduthun capa Galal, Galal capa Shammua, Shammua capa Abda tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kathounge kho dawk kaawm e Levih miphun abuemlah 284 a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hathloilah, longkha karingkung Akub, hoi Talmon hoi hmaunawngha rapan longkha karingkungnaw 172 touh a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kacawie Isarelnaw, vaihmanaw hoi Levihnaw teh, Judah ram kho tangkuem amamae thaw dawk lengkaleng ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatei, Nethinim taminaw teh Ophel vah ao awh. Ziha hoi Gispha teh Nethinim taminaw kahrawikung lah ao roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem kaawm e Levihnaw kahrawikung Asaph capa, la kasaknaw thung dawk hoi Mika, Mika capa Mattaniah, Mattaniah capa Hasabiah, Hasabiah capa Bani, Bani capa Uzziah tinaw doeh. Cathut e im e thaw tawknae dawk lawk katâtuengkung lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh dawk siangpahrang ni kâlawk poe e ao. Lakasaknaw hnintangkuem rawca poe han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah ca catoun hoi Zerah ca catoun thung hoi Meshezabel capa Pethahiah teh, taminaw hoi hno puengpa e lathueng vah siangpahrang e a yueng lah ukkung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hahoi kho hoi ram dawkvah, Judah ca catoun tangawn teh, Kiriath Arba khote hoi Didon khote, Jekabzeel khote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeshua, Moladah, Bethpelet;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazarshual hoi Beersheba khote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziklag hoi Mekonah hoi khote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Enrimmon, Zorah, Jarmuth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoah, Adullam hoi khotenaw hoi Lakhish hoi ram, Azekah hoi khotenaw dawk ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin ca catounnaw hoi Geba im Mikmas vah kho a sak awh. Hahoi, Ai hoi Bethel khotenaw teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anathoth, Nob, Ananiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazar, Ramah, Gittaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid, Zeboiim, Neballat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod hoi Ono hoi kutsakkathoumnaw e ayawn dawk ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hahoi Judah ram ouk kaawm e Levih tami tangawn teh, Benjamin ram dawk ao awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shealtiel capa Zerubbabel hoi Jeshua hnukkâbang e vaihmanaw hoi Levihnaw teh, Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amariah, Malluck, Hattush,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shekaniah, Rehum, Meremoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Iddo, Ginnethon, Abijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mijamin, Maadiah, Bilgah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Salu, Amok, Hilkiah, Jedaiah, hetnaw teh Jeshua se navah vaihmanaw hoi amamae hmaunawnghanaw dawkvah kahrawikungnaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi Levihnaw teh, Jeshua, Binnui, Kedmiel, Sherebiah, Judah hoi Mathaniah, Mathaniah teh a hmaunawnghanaw hoi lunghawilawkdeinae koe kahrawikung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahnimae hmaunawngha Bakbukiah hoi Unni teh la a sak awh navah kadangka lahoi kangdue laihoi a ring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi, Jeshua capa Joiakim, Joiakim capa Eliashib, Eliashib capa Joiada,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada capa Jonathan, Jonathan capa Jaddua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahoi, Joiakim se navah, imthung lahoi na pa lah kaawm e kacue e vaihmanaw teh; Seraiah imthung dawk Meraiah, Jeremiah imthung dawk Hananiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ezra imthung dawk Meshullam, Amariah imthung dawk Jehohanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Malluckhi imthung dawk Jonathan, Shebaniah imthung dawk Joseph,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harim imthung dawk Adna, Meraioth imthung dawk Helkai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Iddo imthung dawk Zekhariah, Ginnethon imthung dawk Meshullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah imthung dawk Zikhri, Miniamin imthung dawk (hitueng min buet touh a kahma), Moadiah imthung dawk Piltai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bilgah imthung dawk Shammua Shemaiah imthung dawk Jehonathan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joiarib imthung dawk Mattenai, Jedaiah imthung dawk Uzzi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sallai imthung dawk Kallai, Amok imthung dawk Eber,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hilkiah imthung dawk Hashabiah, Jedaiah imthung dawk Nethanel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eliashib, Joiada, Johanan hoi Jaddua tinaw e senah, vaihma lah kaawm niteh, napanaw dawk lû lah lengkaleng kaawm e naw hah, Persia tami Darius se totouh, cungpam dawk min pakhum e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eliashib capa Johanan se totouh, Levihnaw imthung lahoi lû lah kaawmnaw hah cungpam dawk min pakhum e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Levihnaw dawk kacuenaw: Hashabiah, Sherebiah hoi Kadmiel capa Jeshua tinaw teh, Cathut e tami Devit e kâpoelawk patetlah a hmaunawnghanaw hoi cungtalah pholen hane hoi, lunghawi lawk dei hanelah, kâletta lahoi a tawk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Meshullam, Telmon hoi Akkub tinaw teh, takhang teng e hnopai ta e hoi takhang ka ring e lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahnimanaw teh Jozadak capa, Jeshua capa, Joiakim se nah, ram ukkung Nehemiah hoi kâlawk kacangkhaikung vaihma Ezra se nah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem rapan hah hnawngnae a sak toteh, cecak, ratoung, tamawi, tum laihoi la sak laihoi, nawmnae, lunghawilawkdeinae hoi cungtalah hnawngnae sak nahanelah, Levihnaw hah a tawng awh teh, a onae hmuen tangkuem koehoi Jerusalem vah a kaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />La kasakthainaw teh Jerusalem kho tengpam koe lah thoseh, Netophah kho hoi thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gilgal im hoi thoseh, Geba hoi Azmaveth ram koehoi thoseh, a mahmawk a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vaihma hoi Levihnaw hai amahoima thoseh, taminaw thoseh, kho longkha thoseh, kho rapan thoseh a thoung sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hattoteh Judah bawinaw hah rapan van ka ceikhai teh, pholen la ka sak hanelah, phu hni touh lah ka kapek. Phu touh teh aranglah hoi a kâhei teh vaipuen longkha koe kho rapan van a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahnimouh hnuk vah Hoshaiah hoi Judah kacuenaw tangawn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azariah, Ezra, Meshullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah, Benjamin, Shemaiah hoi Jeremiah tinaw a kâbang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hahoi mongka ka patuem e vaihmanaw, Jonathan capa, Zekhariah, Shemaiah capa, Mathanial capa, Michaiah capa, Zakkur capa, Asaph capa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hahoi a hmaunawngha, Shemaiah, Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethanel, Judah hoi Hanani tinaw ni, Cathut e tami Devit e tumkhawngnaw heh a patuep awh teh, a kâbang awh. Kâlawk kacangkhaikung Ezra teh ahnimae hmalah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahnimae kadangka lah kaawm e tuiphuek khu longkha koe a pha awh torei, khorapan luennae Devit kho khalai hoi a luen awh teh, Devit im lathueng kanîtholah, Tui longkha totouh a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />La kasakkung tangawn teh avoilah a kamlang awh teh, kai hoi tangawn teh, khorapan van, takhuen imrasang koehoi, khorapan akawnae koe totouh a kâbang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ephraim longkha, longkha karuem, tanga longkha, Hananel imrasang, Meah imrasang koehoi kamtawng teh, tu longkha totouh a kâbang awh hnukkhu, thongim longkha koe a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hahoi la kasakkung phu hni touh teh, Cathut im vah a kangdue awh teh, a tangawn e bawinaw teh kai hoi cungtalah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mongka ka patuem e vaihma Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin,. Mikaiah, Elioenai, Zekhariah hoi Hananiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hahoi, Maaseiah, Shemaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malkhijah, Elam hoi Ezer tinaw hai cungtalah a kangdue awh. La kasakkungnaw teh kahrawikung Jezrahiah hoi cungtalah puenghoi la a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hot hnin vah vaihmanaw ni thuengnae moikapap a sak awh teh, a konawm awh. Puenghoi konawmnae Cathut ni a poe awh dawkvah, yunaw hoi canaw hai a konawm awh. Hatdawkvah, Jerusalem konawnnae hah ahlanae koehoi patenghai thai e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hatnavah Bawkim dawk thaw kakuennaw, vaihmanaw hoi Levihnaw teh karingkung lah ao awh dawkvah, Judahnaw teh a lungkuep awh teh, vaihmanaw hoi Levih ni a pang awh hane pasoumhno aluepaw, pung hra pung touh hah, kho tangkuem hoi a pâkhueng awh teh, hmoun nahane rakhannaw karingkung hanelah thaw a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />La kasakkungnaw hoi tho karingkungnaw hai Devit capa Solomon e kâpoelawk patetlah amamae Cathut thaw hoi thoungnae thaw hah a tawk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Devit hoi Asaph se navah, Cathut koe lunghawilawkdeinae kahrawikungnaw teh ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Zerubbabel hoi Nehemiah se nahai la kasakkungnaw hoi tho karingkungnaw hah, hnintangkuem a pang awh hane rawca hah a poe awh. Levihnaw hah ka thoung hnonaw a poe awh. Levihnaw ni hai Aron capanaw coe hanelah a kapek pouh awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hot hnin vah, Mosi e cauknaw hah taminaw e hmâ lah a touk awh teh, Hote cauk dawkvah Ammonnaw hoi Moabnaw teh Cathut e taminaw kamkhuengnae hmuen koevah, bawk awh van mahoeh telah thut e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Isarelnaw vaiyei hoi tui hoi dawn laipalah, ahnimanaw thoebo sak hanelah Baalam a hlai awh. Hateiteh, kaimae Cathut ni thoebonae hah yawhawinae lah a coung sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hahoi, hote kâlawknaw koung a thai awh hnukkhu, miphun katang hoeh e taminaw teh, Isarel miphun thung hoi a takhoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ha hoehnahlan teh Cathut imrakhan dawk kâtawnnae ka tawn e vaihma Eliashib teh Tobiah hoi a kâkuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatnavah Levih tami lakasakkung longkha karingkungnaw hoi vaihmanaw ni thueng hane kâlawk poe e hoi thuengnae, hahoi hmuitui, hlaumhlaam pung hra pung touh, misurtui hoi satui pung hra pung touh, pâkuemnae hah Tobiah hanelah a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hateiteh, hatnae tueng dawkvah, kai teh Jerusalem vah kaawm hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Babilon siangpahrang Artaxerxes a bawinae kum 32 nah, siangpahrang koe ka ban toe. Hahoi ka saw lah ka o hnukkhu siangpahrang koe ca hoi tâco thainae ca bout ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi Jerusalem ka pha toteh Cathut im dawk rakhan ka sak pouh teh, Tobiah hanelah Eliashib ni a sak e hawihoehnae teh ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lungkuep hoeh tanglang dawkvah, Tobiah imthung hoi e hnopainaw pueng alawilah be ka tâkhawng pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Imrakhannaw thoung sak hanelah kâ ka poe teh, Cathut im thung vah hnopainaw, caneikawinaw hoi, hmuituinaw hah bout ka ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi Levih taminaw, la kasakkungnaw teh ham ka poe hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hote thaw ka tawk e Levihnaw hoi lakasakkungnaw teh amamae lawnaw koe he a cei awh tie hah bout ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cathut e im hah bangkongmaw na pahnawt awh vaw telah bawinaw hah yon a pen teh, Levihnaw hah a kamkhueng sak hnukkhu, amamae hmuen koe bout a hruek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatnavah, Judah ram pueng ni cakang, misurtui, satui pung hra pung touh hah hnoim dawk bout a thokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaihma, Shelemiah, kâlawk kacangkhaikung Zadok hoi, Levihnaw thung dawk e Pedaiah hah thaw ka poe teh, kabawmkung lah Mathaniah capa Zakkur e capa Hanan hah thaw ka poe. Ahnimanaw teh, yuemkamcu hnokahawi ka sak e lah ao teh, a hmaunawnghanaw koe thaw a rei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Oe ka Cathut, hete kong dawk kai na pahnim hanh. Kaie Cathut im hanelah, a thaw ka tawk hane kai ni ka sak e hah raphoe hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatnae tueng navah, Judah ram thungvah sabbath hnin nah misur katinnae tangkom dawk misur bawm hoi cabong moikapap a hrawm awh teh, la e van a thueng awh e thoseh, misurtui hoi, misur paw, thai paw, hotnaw na thueng awh teh, Jerusalem khopui koe lah na phu awh e thoseh ka hmu. Hah hoi ca kawi yo hnin vah kâhruetcuetnae ka poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote hmuen koe kaawm e Tairenaw ni hai, tanga hoi hnopainaw hah Jerusalem khopui koe a phu awh teh, sabbath hnin dawk Judahnaw koe ouk a yo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatnavah kai ni, nangmouh ni sabbath hnin hah na raphoe awh teh, na yon awh e bangtelah namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mintoenaw ni hottelah a sak awh dawkvah, hettelah e kalenpoung roedeng runae hah maimouh dawk thoseh, hete khopui dawk thoseh, Cathut ni phat sak hoeh namaw. Nangmouh ni sabbath hnin na raphoenae lahoi hoe kapatawpoung lah a lungkhueknae hah Isarelnaw koe bout na pha sak han rah maw telah Judah bawinaw hah ka yue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sabbath hnin navah Jerusalem longkhanaw koe khohmo teh, longkha khan han telah kâ ka poe teh, Sabbath hnin abaw hoehnahlan, paawng mahoeh telah kâ bout ka poe. Sabbath hnin nah, bang hno hai kâenkhai hoeh nahanelah, ka sannaw thung e a tangawn longkha ka ring sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hno kayawtnaw, hnocawngca kayawtnaw teh, Jerusalem khopui alawilah avaivai a i awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hot patetlah a lan hoeh e ka panue teh, ahnimouh koe, bangkongmaw rapan kung koe na roe awh. Het patetlah bout na sak awh bawi pawiteh, na tak dawk ka kut ka pho han telah ka ti pouh. Hat totouh hoi teh Sabbath hnin vah tho awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi Levihnaw hah kamthoung sak vaiteh, Sabbath a thoungsak nahanelah, rapan longkha a ring awh hanelah kâ ka poe toe. Oe ka Cathut, hete kong dawk hai na pahnim hanh. Kalenpounge na pahrennae hoi na hlung haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hat navah, Judah tami Ashdod, Amom hoi Moab napuinaw a yu lah a la e hah ka hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A canaw hah Ashdod lawk a pan awh. Hote lawk hloilah teh, Hebru lawk hai pan thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahnimouh hah ka yue teh, thoe ka bo. Atangawn teh ka hemkhai, a sam ka sawn pouh. Na canunaw hah a capanaw la sak hoeh hane hoi ahnimae canu hah na capanaw ni la hoeh hanelah, ahnimouh han thoseh, mamouh han thoseh, canu capa yuvâ hoeh hanelah thoseh, Cathut noe lahoi lawk ka kam sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isarel siangpahrang Solomon hai hot patetlah yonnae a sak nahoehmaw. Hateiteh miphun moikapapnaw thung dawk, ahni patet e siangpahrang awm hoeh. Cathut ni a pahren e doeh. Cathut ni Isarelnaw lathueng vah siangpahrang lah a sak. Hatei, hot patenghai yah talai napuinaw ni yonnae a sak sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hot patetlah ram alouknaw yu lah la vaiteh, Cathut lathueng vah kahawihoehe hno sak hanelah tarawi han nama, telah ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vaihma kacue Eliashib capa, Jehoiada capa buet touh teh, Haron tami Sanballat e cava lah ao dawkvah, kai koehoi tang ka pâlei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Oe Cathut, vaihma lah onae, vaihma lah lawkkamnae, Levihnaw e lawkkamnae, kamhnawng sak dawkvah, pahnim hanh la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hot patetlah talai hnonaw pueng dawk hoi kathoung sak, vaihmanaw hai Levih ni amamae thaw lengkaleng tawk hanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />khoe e atueng dawkvah, thuengnae thing hah, aluepaw ahmaloe e totouh thokhai hanelah, ka pouk pouh. Oe ka Cathut, hawi nahanelah na pahnim hanh.
  </para>
</usx>
